Neuxie
======

Neuxie is a fork of Zephium (https://github.com/zephium-browser/Zephium),
published by the Zephium project under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 (MPL-2.0).
The full license text is in LICENSE at the root of this repository.

This repository is an unaffiliated fork. It is not endorsed by, sponsored by, or
affiliated with the Zephium project or its maintainers. The fork renames the
product surface (application name, identifier, icons, wordmark and user-facing
strings) and adds an experimental Linux build; the browser engine, application
architecture and the overwhelming majority of the source come from Zephium.

The source of this fork is this repository:
https://github.com/neuxora/neuxie-browser

